    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_N4pYgC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits & Features",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>✔️ Brightens your smile naturally without harsh chemicals<br\/>✔️ Freshens breath by helping neutralise odour-causing buildup<br\/>✔️ Helps refresh the mouth and lift impurities as part of your daily routine<br\/>✔️ Helps reduce visible buildup on teeth for a cleaner feel<br\/>✔️ Gentle on teeth and gums — safe for daily use without damaging enamel<br\/>✔️ Convenient sachets make oil pulling easy and portable<br\/>✔️ Crafted with the finest grade coconut oil for effective daily care<br\/>✔️ Rich in antioxidants, supporting your natural oral care routine<br\/>✔️ Soothes the mouth and supports a clean, fresh feel<br\/>✔️ Enhances your oral care routine, turning it into a refreshing ritual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Finest Grade Coconut Oil<\/li><li>Peppermint Oil<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>100% & Natural<\/strong><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Rip the sachet and pour the contents into your mouth<\/p><p>2. Swish the oil around your mouth<br\/><em>(Recommended to keep in your mouth for 5-8 minutes)<\/em><\/p><p>3. Spit & Rinse<\/p><p><strong>Recommended to use daily!<\/strong><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1efe8090-8cc3-4d87-874c-e2af1cea652a": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Whats in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Each order of Coconut Oil Pulling Mouthwash of 16 Sachets. <\/strong><\/p><p>16x individually packed strips for individual uses<\/p><p>1x Manual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>Keep out of reach of children.<\/p><p>Do not swallow the oil; spit it out after use.<\/p><p>Consult a dentist if you have dental issues.<\/p><p>Store in a cool, dry place and seal tightly.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The science behind Coconut Oil Pulling:",
            "icon": "eye",
            "row_content": "<p>Coconut oil pulling has been used for generations as a natural addition to oral care routines. Our single-serve sachets are packed with high-quality coconut oil, naturally rich in lauric acid—a fatty acid widely recognised for its cleansing properties.<br\/><br\/>This daily swishing ritual helps remove debris and impurities from the mouth, leaving your breath feeling fresh and your mouth revitalised. With its smooth consistency and light coconut taste, it’s a simple yet powerful way to elevate your self-care routine.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wPUNyh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can Coconut Oil Pulling be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, coconut oil pulling is safe for composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. Its antibacterial properties help maintain oral hygiene without damaging dental work. The gentle, non-abrasive nature of coconut oil preserves the integrity of cosmetic materials.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
